%% The Bridge — happy path sequence (WEBHOOK default)
%% Figure 6.2
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Agent as AI Agent
  participant Adapter as Agent Adapter
  participant Bridge as Bridge gRPC/Engine
  participant Kafka as Kafka workflow-events
  participant Guardian as Guardian HTTP :8001
  participant Vault as Vault WS client
  participant Wake as WakeProvider + SSE

  Agent->>Adapter: MCP send_action(platform, sessionId, actionType, params)
  Adapter->>Adapter: pairing resolve + optional PII sanitize
  Adapter->>Bridge: SendAction(ActionRequest + WEBHOOK context)
  Bridge->>Bridge: persist ActionEntity + WorkflowEntity RECEIVED
  Bridge-->>Adapter: ActionResponse RECEIVED (requestId, workflowId)
  Adapter-->>Agent: requestId, workflowId, RECEIVED
  Bridge->>Kafka: ActionCreatedEvent
  Kafka->>Bridge: WorkflowEngine.process
  Bridge->>Guardian: GET /v1/authenticate/agent?did=
  Guardian-->>Bridge: status=verified
  Bridge->>Kafka: GuardianApprovedEvent
  Bridge->>Vault: payment_request or form_fill_request
  Vault-->>Bridge: action_approved
  Bridge->>Kafka: ActionResponseReceivedEvent
  Bridge->>Bridge: Action COMPLETED, Workflow COMPLETED
  Bridge->>Adapter: POST /webhook/bridge (HMAC if HTTP MCP)
  Adapter->>Wake: ContinuationService → WakeDispatcher
  Wake-->>Agent: Claude channel / provider API / SSE workflow.updated
